   The requested identity lifecycle fix has no regression test. Existing tests only assert the initialization option for SPA pageviews; none exercise anonymous startup, identified startup, anonymous→identified, identified→anonymous, or user-A→user-B transitions. The subtle requirement that returning anonymous users retain their anonymous ID can regress without any failure.

   Exact snippet:
