      "issueCode": "async_correctness",
      "description": "Token refreshes are not associated with the identity or request generation that started them. An owner-A query can remain in flight while logout or an owner-B login clears/reloads the store, then resolve afterward and overwrite the store with owner A's token metadata. Capture an identity epoch and discard stale results, or cancel the prior request.",
      "location": "src/routes/settings/index.tsx",
      "codePart": "  const refreshIntegrationTokens = $(async () => {
    const client = convexClientSig.value;
    if (!client || auth.value.provider !== "convex") {
      store.integrationTokens = [];
      store.integrationTokensLoaded = true;
